        </?01M0PYNPC1H9WM62GB1Q8HH45K>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task #P2-T1 { name = "Implement exact StepSpace filesystem assembly" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 0 } (
            <Description ?01M0PYNPC1H9WM62GB1Q8HH45M>
            Load a profile root plus explicit StepSpace/Step/Extension refs using raw bytes, fatal decode, containment and deterministic identity/digest rules.
