            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #P2-T1-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M0PYNPC1H9WM62GB1Q8HH45N>
              Editing one referenced step/extension changes only that file and the complete artifact digest; unrelated bytes and refs remain exact.
