            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #P2-T2-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PG2>
              StepSpace and equivalent inline fixtures produce semantically equal canonical profile bindings.
              </?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PG2>
              <Criterion #P2-T2-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PG3>
              Order-fulfillment and a multi-step AIData example use modular steps/extensions and pass authored example type/DSL gates.
              </?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PG3>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
        <Gate [
          <Criterion #P2-G1 { checked = true } ?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PG4>
          Ctrl/Data loader, freeze, definition-instance isolation, examples and Flow DSL tests pass.
          </?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PG4>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P3 { name = "Root-last step record persistence" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 2 } (
        <Description ?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PG5>
        Replace full-file physical rewrites with immutable step records selected by one CAS checkpoint head while preserving the complete logical checkpoint contract.
        </?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PG5>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task #P3-T1 { name = "Implement Merkle step record codec" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 0 } (
            <Description ?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PG6>
            Add storage envelope, immutable record/tree codecs, digest readback, root-last admission, interruption recovery and one-way direct-checkpoint import.
            </?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PG6>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #P3-T1-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PG7>
              A one-step or one-extension transition writes changed records, a logarithmic tree path, receipt and head; unchanged records remain byte-identical.
              </?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PG7>
              <Criterion #P3-T1-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PG8>
              Every controlled interruption restores one complete old/new head; unreachable candidates, malformed records, symlinks and CAS races never become current.
              </?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PG8>
              <Criterion #P3-T1-AC3 { checked = true } ?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PG9>
              Load reconstructs an exactly normalized logical FlowRunCheckpoint and the old direct-file form imports once without dual write.
              </?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PG9>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task #P3-T2 { name = "Persist Ctrl Data and extension facts" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 1 } (
            <Description ?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PGA>
            Split exact profile step facts, retain run-level AI state, and prove fresh recovery, patches, waits, results and derived observations.
            </?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PGA>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #P3-T2-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PGB>
              Ctrl waits/branches/orchestration and Data nodes/results/invalidations reconstruct with all existing reciprocal and transition invariants; runtime membership derives only from frozen binding and accepted patch/orchestration facts.
