              <Criterion #P3-T2-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PGC>
              Accepted effectful Data results are not replayed after fresh recovery; BPCtrl task state remains in TaskSpaceStore only.
              </?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PGC>
              <Criterion #P3-T2-AC3 { checked = true } ?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PGD>
              A 256-step benchmark records bounded changed bytes/records and no O(total step payload) rewrite for a one-step update.
              </?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PGD>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
        <Gate [
          <Criterion #P3-G1 { checked = true } ?01M0PYNPC24PR4RQZ2W14R6PGE>
